                                Un agent IA peut-il faire des erreurs ?
                                <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span>
